<title>USA: MacKenzie names John Kelly to head new LA office.</title>
<headline>MacKenzie names John Kelly to head new LA office.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>MacKenzie Partners Inc said on Wednesday it named John Kelly as senior vice president to head its new office in Los Angeles.</p>
<p>Prior to joining MacKenzie Partners, Kelly served as a consultant for Johnnie D Johnson &amp; Co Inc, an investor relations agency.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
